\cf5 \cb6 \strokec5 As a media buyer for a real estate company, I would recommend the following print ad campaign to reach throughout New England for a $2,000,000 listing located 15 miles north of Boston:\cb1 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
