\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Boston Globe: The Boston Globe is the largest newspaper in New England and has a daily circulation of over 200,000. We would place a full-page color ad in the real estate section, which is read by a large number of affluent home buyers and real estate professionals.\cb1 \
\ls1\ilvl0\cb6 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 New England Home Magazine: New England Home is a regional luxury home and design magazine with a circulation of over 50,000. We would place a full-page color ad in the magazine to target high-end home buyers and real estate professionals in the area.\cb1 \
\ls1\ilvl0\cb6 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 The Wall Street Journal: The Wall Street Journal is a national newspaper with a daily circulation of over 2 million. We would place a half-page color ad in the real estate section to reach a wider audience, including out-of-state buyers who may be interested in purchasing a second home in the New England area.\cb1 \
