\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Local Real Estate Magazines: We would also place ads in local real estate magazines, such as the North Shore Real Estate Guide and the Greater Boston Real Estate Guide. These magazines have a targeted audience of home buyers and real estate professionals in the area and are distributed throughout New England.\cb1 \
