\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Online Advertising: In addition to print advertising, we would also run online ads targeting home buyers and real estate professionals in New England. This would include display ads on local real estate websites, such as Zillow and Redfin, as well as targeted social media ads on platforms like Facebook and Instagram.\cb1 \
